Definition: Thunder Bot stuns enemies in an area around the bot and then applies a lingering slow effect after the stun ends.
Unlocking/Upgrading:
Like all bots, Thunder Bot is unlocked and upgraded in the Event Shop menu.
The unlock cost depends on how many other bots have been bought.
The raw source says each of Thunder Bot's upgrade rows starts from the shared 100-medal base ladder and increases by 40 medals each level.
Upgrade Stats:
Duration
Cooldown
Linger
Range
Behavior:
Thunder Bot stuns enemies in an area around the bot.
Once the stun ends, enemies are slowed by the linger effect.
Stun and linger are 50% effective against Bosses and Elites.
Duration starts at 5 seconds.
Cooldown starts at 120 seconds.
Linger starts at 20%.
Range starts at 25m.
Range increases the area the bot covers while active.
Labs:
Thunder Bot Cooldown unlocks in Milestones at Tier 5 Wave 70 and reduces bot cooldown by 1 second per level. Has 25 levels for 25 seconds total reduction.
Thunder Bot Linger Time unlocks in Milestones at Tier 10 Wave 60 and increases linger duration by 0.5s per level. Has 20 levels for 13 seconds total linger duration.
Interactions:
Thunder Bot range is amplified by tower range.
Thunder Bot stun and linger are only 50% effective against Bosses and Elites.

